Let's start by finding the project "Website Redesign" and its issues. Linear GraphQL:

```graphql
{
  project(name: "Website Redesign") {
    id
    name
    issues(first: 50) {
      nodes {
        id
        identifier
        title
        description
        priority
        state {
          name
        }
        team {
          key
          name
        }
        completedAt
      }
    }
  }
}
```

